heading\">ATELIER <strong> :  O\u00f9 en est-on 3 ans apr\u00e8s le lancement du Plan Outremer ?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Mercredi 16 octobre 2024<\/strong><br><a href=\"https:\/\/fgo-barbara.fr\/\">14h \u2013 <\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/fgo-barbara.fr\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">FGO Barbara<\/a> \u2013 Panel Room 3 \/\/ <a href=\"https:\/\/www.mama-musicandconvention.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MaMA<\/a> \/ Paris<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/mama-musicandconvention.com\/event\/ou-en-est-on-3-ans-apres-le-lancement-du-plan-outremer\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Infos compl\u00e8tes<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><br><strong>TABLE RONDE : Quels enjeux pour les musiques actuelles face \u00e0 la mont\u00e9e de l\u2019extr\u00eame droite ?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Vendredi 18 octobre 2024<\/strong><br><a href=\"http:\/\/lyc-jacques-decour.scola.ac-paris.fr\/\">13h<\/a><a href=\"http:\/\/lyc-jacques-decour.scola.ac-paris.fr\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"> \u2013 Lyc\u00e9e J.Decour &#8211; Th\u00e9\u00e2tre<\/a> \/\/ <a href=\"https:\/\/www.mama-musicandconvention.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MaMA<\/a> \/ Paris<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/mama-musicandconvention.com\/event\/quels-enjeux-pour-les-musiques-actuelles-face-a-la-montee-de-lextreme-droite-au-pouvoir\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Infos compl\u00e8tes<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p